Current Version can be found [[Rock|here]].

Rock was added in '''Beta 4.2''' as a 3/6 for 6G Taunt monster with the ability to summon a Pebble in its place when it dies. '''Beta 4.3''' gave it -1 HP already, while '''Beta 5.0''' gave it -1 ATK instead (bringing its HP back up to 6, but bringing its ATK down to 2, making it vulnerable to [[Muffet's Pet]]). '''Beta 6.5''' gave it -1 HP and '''Beta 14.0''' gave it +1 HP again, while '''Beta 54.1''' gave it +1 ATK, bringing it back to its very first version.

